{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "c81813a67ffd2f0176fdbb74dfa7b80ac9f361d8319c35426c3cc8aaa7789c4f", "ja": "魅裏怨 -がっこう-", "zh": "魅里怨──学校", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "43685c44ad642f1dc6506c6b03e0d1c4539e6fcc090ad8280449f44710fd08f9", "ja": "夜になっても帰宅していない美奈子を探す、\n可奈と瑞希。学校にやってきたふたりは、旧\n校舎に向かう可憐を目撃する。そして、可憐\nを捕まえようとしたその時、ポルターガイス\nトが一同に襲いかかってくるのだった。", "zh": "可奈和瑞希寻找着入夜仍未返家的美奈子。\n来到学校的两人，目击到可怜前往旧校舍。\n正当她们打算抓住可怜时，\n却发生骚灵现象袭击她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "88bc5c0ff21022cf6897b7cc23c7736d6f0a88293dc5afc532c21c047881476c", "ja": "あ、あの～、瑞希さん……。\n本当に、学校に美奈子さんがいるんですか……？", "zh": "那、那个～瑞希……\n美奈子她真的在学校吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "78a622b413c53612694e1c960cee7d8de4e216490a5abe4fee822e67d3ff8ea9", "ja": "はい。矢吹さんがさっき話してくれたことが\n本当ならば。……おそらく。", "zh": "是的，若矢吹同学刚才跟我讲的都是真的……\n我想她大概在学校。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "3029a5422a9dc02db87057cd73919462f66db2148f49fa21e80bd779cd3a9c1e", "ja": "ほ、本当です。心配になって、\n美奈子さんに電話をかけたら……。", "zh": "是、是真的。\n我担心地打电话给美奈子，结果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "f301a996ca7fe89bbac3862b20946f3a6eb0e29b99e12aeec9af212ed779a5af", "ja": "全国大会まで、あと1週間もない。\nもっともっと練習しなきゃ。ふふ、うふふ……！", "zh": "距离全国大赛剩不到一周了，\n必须更努力练习才行。呵呵，呵呵……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "f301a996ca7fe89bbac3862b20946f3a6eb0e29b99e12aeec9af212ed779a5af", "ja": "全国大会まで、あと1週間もない。\nもっともっと練習しなきゃ。ふふ、うふふ……！", "zh": "距离全国大赛剩不到一周了，\n必须更努力练习才行。呵呵，呵呵……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "6bf4fc419d83ecfec664f0facef0a4b5a770cf64ade963026382605115085c2c", "ja": "み、美奈子さん……？\n美奈子さん、どうしたの？　返事して！", "zh": "美、美奈子……？\n美奈子，你怎么了？快回答我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "bcbc9f54d460178aba32aa0bbdd206f5657bfdcf916178a30f792a42cb17b34f", "ja": "気になって家にいっても、美奈子さんいなくて……。\nどうしようって、すごく心配になってて……。", "zh": "我不安地去了美奈子家，结果她不在家……\n我非常担心，不知道该怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "ee4875116e3c1a213a0e37d9ff164195a5369abe2aaaa7b0498ab7b347a2b421", "ja": "おそらく、佐竹さんはぷっぷかさんに\n和三盆をお供えしなかった。", "zh": "我想佐竹同学恐怕没有供奉\n和三盆给噗、噗卡小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "9dbbda889f11dd3c06ca0dadd18367878066f4d38fa1443b2c9fdad7da08b96f", "ja": "だから、ぷっぷかさんに呪われて……？\nあの、ぷっぷかさんって、いったい……？", "zh": "所以她被噗、噗卡小姐诅咒了……？\n请问，噗、噗卡小姐她到底是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "8a869946df60d9f230fec2503a40c43954bf1599b75c793e9990af731be20aff", "ja": "実は……ぷっぷかさんは3年前に亡くなった吹奏楽部の\n生徒なのではないか……という説があります。", "zh": "噗、噗卡小姐……有可能是三年前过世的管乐社学生……\n其实有这种说法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "34343b520d1c9165faad40b72773bca3fa444369bafee2d0183ab7b4d5808c00", "ja": "えっ、吹奏楽部？\nじゃあ、私の先輩ですか？", "zh": "咦，管乐社？\n那么她是我的学姊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "05ac2723c845cc9c3fc804f4467e4851f33b9c74974e896494b81132bf9e4522", "ja": "わかりません。……ですが、ぷっぷかさんは学校の噂。\n噂ではなく真実なら、戻る場所は学校。のはず。", "zh": "我不清楚……不过，噗、噗卡小姐是学校里的传闻。\n若刚刚说的并非传闻而是事实，那她应该会回学校才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "c47c6902da7702f298b03abd268e081a31c69f1ad8aea9240e97dc8743487e3e", "ja": "よ、よおし。出～るなら出てこい、ぷっぷかさ～ん♪\n美奈子さんは絶対渡さ～ん♪", "zh": "好、好了！要～出来就出来吧，噗、噗卡小姐～♪\n我绝对不把美奈子交给你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "4be21e27245b3193aeb8f018d0c597335af6a6ce2f84d141e0b5fe1ea7c66bc9", "ja": "矢吹さん、人影が、旧校舎に入っていきます。\nあの人は確か……篠宮可憐さん。", "zh": "矢吹同学，有个人影进去旧校舍了。\n那个人我记得是……筿宫可怜同学。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "48af7452774b3d6487045ac65a8875ddb7c045d095dc78b22cd9c9aeef5063b6", "ja": "美奈子さんのクラスの転校生……ですよね？\nなんで夜の旧校舎に？", "zh": "她是美奈子班上的转学生……对吧？\n为什么她会去晚上的旧校舍？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "9957cecc092dc2e4e3ad1dcdcea1342537aaa60b66f1dd681b077af5cc293f79", "ja": "わかりません。……でも、あやしい。\n気づかれないよう、追いかけましょう。", "zh": "不知道……但是很可疑。\n我们追上去吧，小心别被发现了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "c6221a7c15d69ed07a0c6f9367539331f6528bbda92c74475b324270f2db36d0", "ja": "……っ！　あ、あなた達は……。", "zh": "……！\n你、你们是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "eea10cb94f6a822f4a972e4759b4ea6c6a55dc89ccf9e24ce0c415c7da472f84", "ja": "やはりあなたでしたか。\n篠宮さん……いえ……。", "zh": "果然是你呀，\n筿宫同学……不对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "7d08eb637cae7e92c0c7ac31a931f7c9e818ff1116f10fd460b008761056e2b8", "ja": "ぷっぷかさん！", "zh": "噗、噗卡小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "c8ef970984ba3a01fefceae3db0b754d8d134366dc950f3d770ec025356e1565", "ja": "え、えええ～っ！？\nあなたが、ぷっぷかさんだったんですか！？", "zh": "咦、咦咦咦～！？\n你就是噗、噗卡小姐吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "62e99c0dd90c948ff0e9830b5f3be08e3adf320fa30d72caaf2bb9a3c8594abd", "ja": "でも、そういえば……\nいきなり転校してくるなんて、あやしすぎます！", "zh": "不过，真要说起来……\n突然转学过来实在是太可疑了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "b0fe95f3bc45bd8545b394d45984bc07eaf0da45cbf0b8cda5f11e62ada65033", "ja": "そ、そんなぁ……！", "zh": "怎、怎么这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1021_se", "source_sha256": "8a68aea98da19aec51ae389bc46d25dc55441184cbf1d50967b3f010d93d9d39", "ja": "ガタッ……ガタッ……", "zh": "喀哒……喀哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "263ec8c670f58ae4847268c98dedb2afe37b6b1b37f9ad7a54cbbb58a4509569", "ja": "ひゃあっ！　み、瑞希さん、椅子と楽器が\n浮き上がって……飛び回ってますよ～っ！", "zh": "呀啊！瑞、瑞希，椅子跟乐器飘起来了……\n而且还到处飞来飞去～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "9d00c489a9d307248a171120de41b8bb7266b8a61083fe41c7a24f663bc98b5a", "ja": "これはまさしく、ポルターガイスト。\n……大迫力。", "zh": "这正是所谓的骚灵现象。\n……震撼力十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "34c9223943feab30d1e94dce20bf653521ee9296c53017c2dec1d4711d76152e", "ja": "お、おふたりとも……ここは、危ないですから……。\nあ、安全な、ところに……逃げ……。", "zh": "你、你们两位……这里很危险的……\n快、快点逃去……安全的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "3d9dd6be74b90203edb84ac08a56e70b9dcf24e91ccf044c57eda4b612b91089", "ja": "ドア、開きません。……絶体絶命。", "zh": "门打不开……（穷途末路）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "7bd751227e9eeaaa5de2fa5d39fd0717dc81f840b10b33306b86262c9422e1c2", "ja": "そんな……っ！　わ、私……こんなところで死ねない\nも～んっ！　絶対美奈子さんを助けるんだも～んっ！", "zh": "怎么会……！我、我……才不会在这种地方死掉呢～！\n我绝对要救出美奈子～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "964d35b6e54b27f0c1f3100675ec740caa960a8bdbe22e2d7022cc1af5c6956b", "ja": "なんと。心霊現象が収まりました。……チャンス。", "zh": "太惊人了，灵异现象停止了……好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "d910822497b6dc117548d58b6a47b3e5f5dc9b6efea670520d01f1e00c99ed5c", "ja": "は、はい。あ、悪霊よ、主の、い、威光を畏れよ～。\nせ、聖なる神の恩寵が、汝ら邪悪を打ち祓う……。", "zh": "没、没错。恶、恶灵啊，震慑于主的光辉吧～\n圣、圣洁的神所赐予的恩宠，将驱除汝等邪恶之物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "3df15a36fb89d3b8c6799e03b640d753cdd22ea380b517d9d5bd3f2d03143eaf", "ja": "しゅ、主よ御力を貸し与えたまえ、\n災いより我らを守りたまえ……え～いっ！", "zh": "主、主啊，请将您的力量借给我，\n从灾厄中守护我等……看我的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "2c1c548820c7be16cea56ff9a554f62754f6d970e2cbc10786418bbf2bb77321", "ja": "おお……ドアが、開きました。", "zh": "喔喔……门打开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "7e3c8ee93cbaf00b40e57b8cb7a5eef9f28b0f8c4c8be7da02e5ffd2d719dd30", "ja": "い、今のうちです……。おそらく、あ、足止めにしか\nなりませんから……に、逃げましょう……。", "zh": "快、快趁现在……这恐怕只、只能拖延一点时间……\n我、我们快逃吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_04_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "e5f0ac26660fc7f24d18fa9aba51f3a86a97dd600cc01ea3c83312beeb81ced0", "ja": "待ってください！　美奈子さんがまだ音楽室に……\n美奈子さーん！", "zh": "请等一下！美奈子还在音乐教室里……\n美奈子──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
